From 56260cb5dc5569946d14fe6b39586b6befd6a4ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:54:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] Add ESP32 Bluetooth power control

Provide C3 Bluetooth block power control and explicit unsupported
operations on other chips; interrupt routing is installed separately.

Consolidates legacy kernel patches: 0012, 0014, 0015, 0017, 0035, 0037.

Co-authored-by: Peter Madsen-Mygdal <petermm@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Peter Madsen-Mygdal <petermm@gmail.com>
---
 bsps/riscv/esp32/bt/bt_c3.c       | 239 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 bsps/riscv/esp32/include/bsp/bt.h | 162 ++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 401 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 bsps/riscv/esp32/bt/bt_c3.c
 create mode 100644 bsps/riscv/esp32/include/bsp/bt.h

